CinnabarVolcano_RightCorridor_3F_Text_KiraIntro::
    .string "Hot ground, narrow path...\n"
    .string "Perfect footwork practice!$"

CinnabarVolcano_RightCorridor_3F_Text_KiraDefeat::
    .string "Clean movement!$"

CinnabarVolcano_RightCorridor_3F_Text_KiraPostBattle::
    .string "A battle here teaches balance\n"
    .string "better than any dojo floor.$"

CinnabarVolcano_RightCorridor_3F_Text_ColeIntro::
    .string "Can you handle a little fire\n"
    .string "inside a volcano?$"

CinnabarVolcano_RightCorridor_3F_Text_ColeDefeat::
    .string "You smothered my spark!$"

CinnabarVolcano_RightCorridor_3F_Text_ColePostBattle::
    .string "The best flames don't flare up.\n"
    .string "They keep burning steady.$"

CinnabarVolcano_RightCorridor_3F_Text_KogaFountain::
    .string "KOGA: Fwahahaha!\p"
    .string "You made it this far.\n"
    .string "Together, no less.\p"
    .string "Then the lesson has already\n"
    .string "taken root.$"

CinnabarVolcano_RightCorridor_3F_Text_KogaLiftStone::
    .string "KOGA grips the LAVIC STONE\n"
    .string "with both hands...\p"
    .string "...But it does not move.$"

CinnabarVolcano_RightCorridor_3F_Text_KogaNeedStrength::
    .string "KOGA: Hmph!\n"
    .string "Even quenched, it resists me.\p"
    .string "We need more strength to lift\n"
    .string "this stone from its resting place.$"

CinnabarVolcano_RightCorridor_3F_Text_JanineArrives::
    .string "JANINE: Then I made it in time.\p"
    .string "Father, you said togetherness\n"
    .string "was the point of this trial.$"

CinnabarVolcano_RightCorridor_3F_Text_KogaTryTogether::
    .string "KOGA: Hah!\n"
    .string "You are right, JANINE.\p"
    .string "Then we shall try together.$"

CinnabarVolcano_RightCorridor_3F_Text_PullTogether::
    .string "KOGA, JANINE, and {PLAYER}\n"
    .string "pull with all their strength!$"

CinnabarVolcano_RightCorridor_3F_Text_StonePulledFree::
    .string "The LAVIC STONE breaks loose\n"
    .string "from the volcanic rock!$"

CinnabarVolcano_RightCorridor_3F_Text_KogaOfficialChallenge::
    .string "KOGA: Together, we freed the\n"
    .string "stone.\p"
    .string "Back at the GYM, this will become\n"
    .string "the heart of new ninja tools.\p"
    .string "But before I return, I want to\n"
    .string "battle you here.\p"
    .string "JANINE stands beside me as my\n"
    .string "GYM aide.\p"
    .string "That makes this challenge\n"
    .string "official.$"

CinnabarVolcano_RightCorridor_3F_Text_KogaReadyToBattle::
    .string "Are you ready to battle KOGA?$"

CinnabarVolcano_RightCorridor_3F_Text_KogaBattleIntro::
    .string "KOGA: Then show me the strength\n"
    .string "you bring to your allies!$"

CinnabarVolcano_RightCorridor_3F_Text_KogaDefeat::
    .string "Fwahahaha!\n"
    .string "A worthy victory!$"

CinnabarVolcano_RightCorridor_3F_Text_KogaPostJanine::
    .string "KOGA: The LAVIC STONE waits.\p"
    .string "With JANINE here, we may yet\n"
    .string "move it.$"

CinnabarVolcano_RightCorridor_3F_Text_KogaPostStone::
    .string "KOGA: Together, even stubborn\n"
    .string "stone must yield.\p"
    .string "Now, let us make this trial\n"
    .string "official.$"

CinnabarVolcano_RightCorridor_3F_Text_KogaAfterBattle::
    .string "KOGA: Return to FUCHSIA GYM\n"
    .string "when you are ready.\p"
    .string "There, the LAVIC STONE will become\n"
    .string "tools worthy of our clan.$"

CinnabarVolcano_RightCorridor_3F_Text_JaninePostArrival::
    .string "JANINE: If this is for our clan's\n"
    .string "tools, then I should help too.$"

CinnabarVolcano_RightCorridor_3F_Text_JaninePostStone::
    .string "JANINE: Father never makes these\n"
    .string "lessons easy.\p"
    .string "But I think that was the point.$"
